## 📊 What You'll Learn

### Technical Skills
- AWS Security (IAM, GuardDuty, Security Hub, CloudTrail, Config, KMS, Secrets Manager)
- Infrastructure as Code (Terraform)
- Container Security (Docker, image scanning, runtime security)
- Kubernetes Security (RBAC, network policies, pod security)
- DevSecOps (CI/CD pipelines, security gates, SBOM, signing)
- Cloud-Native Security (EKS, service mesh, policy as code)

### Certifications Targeted
- AWS Certified Security - Specialty
- Certified Kubernetes Security Specialist (CKS)
- HashiCorp Terraform Associate

### Deliverables
- 8+ portfolio projects
- Complete GitHub repository
- Security documentation
- Architecture diagrams
- Runnable code and configurations

